  m_Name: Cassandra - Entry 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  storyText: "PATIENT: Cassandra Bouchat\nDATE: June 3/1981\n\n\tToday's session with
    Cassandra had a rocky start. When she realized that I had a mustard stain on my
    coat, it was difficult to for her to concentrate. After practicing a few breathing
    excersises, she regained focus and was able to converse normally again. The theme
    of today's meeting revolved around her husband. She expressed disapppointment
    with his inability to keep their apartment up to her standards. She also expressed
    some trust issues regarding his constant overtime hours... \n\t\t>> 1. BACK"
